    "body": "Mentioned by @WoosukKwon in https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/23233.\n\nThe work to update logits processor states and construct the sampling metadata be deferred in model runner `execute_model` to overlap CPU with forward pass.\n\nThis has an advantage of taking the logits processor `update_states` calls off the critical path, and means we can trade off a bit of efficiency for simplicity in the API design.\n\nThere should be some incremental benefit as we migrate hard-wired sampling parameters into logits processors since their state updates are still happening in `_update_states()` before the forward pass.",
